Rule 18 (Example with string constant.)
{input : tensor} |= dtype_(input) ≠ 11
>>
Rule 19 (Input cannot be boolean.)
{input : tensor} |= dtype_(input) ≠ 0
>>
Rule 20 (Out cannot be boolean if input is not.)
{input : tensor, out : tensor} |= if dtype_(input) ≠ 0 then dtype_(out) ≠ 0
>>
Rule 37 (If out is specified, the shapes of input and out tensors must be identical.)
{input : tensor, out : tensor} |= if out ≠ false then shape(input) = shape(out)
